This crate is the C ABI surface over OpenMLS described in
specs/backend/relay/mls-binding.md. It ships under the same license as the relay
because an independent implementation cannot be verified against a binding it
cannot read.

This crate links OpenMLS and its dependencies, which carry their own licenses.
Their terms are unchanged by this notice.

The Weald macOS client is a separate work and is NOT covered by this license.
